{"id":"n14733-1-7","stage":2,"title":"도로 · 返","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14733-1-7-1","ko":"길을 잃었다면서 숙소를 잘 찾아왔구나.","zh":"你说迷路了，不过还真顺利找到了住宿的地方啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길을","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길을","audio":"/audio/a41fdccc5780433c53cc.mp3"}},{"text":"잃었다면서","meaning":"迷失","explanation":"잃다：迷失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"9","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃었다면서","audio":"/audio/164c6ab99118698109f4.mp3"}},{"text":"숙소를","meaning":"住处，落脚点","explanation":"숙소：住处，落脚点；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숙소","audio":"/audio/d1f8c8aeb195a0431285.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65002","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙소를","audio":"/audio/27e58c980fb3105cd80e.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아왔구나.","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아왔구나","audio":"/audio/fc20979f203d907f484b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"迷失","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"失去方向或迷路。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"d1f8c8aeb195a043","term":"숙소","zh":"住处，落脚点","audio":"/audio/d1f8c8aeb195a0431285.mp3","entryId":"65002","definition":"临时停留住宿的地方。","pronunciation":["숙쏘"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"来找，来访，访问","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"来见某人或做某事。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/390266537932d20515da.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14733-1-7-2","ko":"왔던 길로 도로 되돌아오다 보니 아는 길이 나오더라고요.","zh":"沿着来时的路原路返回，就又遇到了熟悉的路呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왔던","meaning":"经由，途经","explanation":"오다：经由，途经；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"22","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔던","audio":"/audio/a02204c428d3ac3fd08f.mp3"}},{"text":"길로","meaning":"路，道，道路","explanation":"길：路，道，道路；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"1","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길로","audio":"/audio/b49b08c219621fef1f9b.mp3"}},{"text":"도로","meaning":"返，又","explanation":"도로：返，又","readings":[{"term":"도로","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14733","senseId":"1","lemma":"도로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도로","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3"}},{"text":"되돌아오다","meaning":"返回，折回，回来","explanation":"되돌아오다：返回，折回，回来；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"되돌아오다","audio":"/audio/85d5daf629474b2a96c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14917","senseId":"1","lemma":"되돌아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되돌아오다","audio":"/audio/85d5daf629474b2a96c8.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"表示做了前面所指的行为后，领悟到后面所指的事实，或成为后面所指的状态。","explanation":"보다：表示做了前面所指的行为后，领悟到后面所指的事实，或成为后面所指的状态。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"아는","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아는","audio":"/audio/4ac69e5a586c3d19cbfa.mp3"}},{"text":"길이","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}},{"text":"나오더라고요.","meaning":"出现","explanation":"나오다：出现；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"20","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오더라고요","audio":"/audio/6223dc31caa7544213d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"经由，途经","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"经过某条路，向这边移动。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，道，道路；路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"供人或车等通行的，以一定宽度延伸的长长的地面上空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"60982a61e50d3bea","term":"도로","zh":"返，又","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3","entryId":"14733","definition":"与前行的方向相反地。","pronunciation":["도로"]},{"id":"85d5daf629474b2a","term":"되돌아오다","zh":"返回，折回，回来","audio":"/audio/85d5daf629474b2a96c8.mp3","entryId":"14917","definition":"重新回到原来的地方。","pronunciation":["되도라오다","뒈도라오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"表示做了前面所指的行为后，领悟到后面所指的事实，或成为后面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示做了前面所指的行为后，领悟到后面所指的事实，或成为后面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识，相识","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"以前见过，或有过交流而亲密往来。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"能看到目的地。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d7a25ba7c86e1249961.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.995,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14733","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3955,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你说迷路了，不过还真顺利找到了住宿的地方啊。","沿着来时的路原路返回，就又遇到了熟悉的路呢。","金选手，您对这次游泳比赛能获得奖牌很有信心吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你说迷路了，不过还真顺利找到了住宿的地方啊。","沿着来时的路原路返回，就又遇到了熟悉的路呢。","金选手，您对这次游泳比赛能获得奖牌很有信心吧？"],"answer":1}]}
